msgstr "Kalendar"

#. (itstool) path: component/summary
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: org.kde.kalendar.appdata.xml:10
msgid "Manage your tasks and events with speed and ease"
msgstr "Xestione as súas tarefas e eventos de forma rápida e fácil."

#. (itstool) path: component/developer_name
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: org.kde.kalendar.appdata.xml:13
msgid "KDE Community, Clau Cambra and Carl Schwan"
msgstr "Comunidade KDE, Clau Cambra e Carl Schwan"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: org.kde.kalendar.appdata.xml:15
msgid ""
"Kalendar is a calendar application that allows you to manage your tasks and"
" events. Kalendar supports both local calendars as well as a multitude of"
" online calendars: Nextcloud, Google® Calendar, Outlook®, Caldav, and many"
" more."
msgstr ""
"Kalendar é unha aplicación de calendarios que lle permite xestionar as"
" tarefas e eventos. Kalendar permite tanto calendarios locais como varios"
" calendarios por Internet: de Nextcloud, de Google Calendar, de Outlook, de"
" Caldav e de máis servizos."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: org.kde.kalendar.appdata.xml:16
msgid ""
"Kalendar gives you many ways to interact with your events. The month view"
" provides an overview of the entire month; the week view presents a detailed"
" hour-by-hour overview of your week; and the schedule view lists all of your"
" upcoming events so that you can easily and quickly plan ahead."
msgstr ""
"Kalendar dálle moitas formas de interactuar cos seus eventos. A vista mensual"
" fornece unha vista xeral dun mes enteiro. A semanal presenta unha vista"
" xeral detallada por horas dunha semana. A vista de planificación lista todos"
" os eventos futuros para que poida elaborar plans facilmente."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: org.kde.kalendar.appdata.xml:17
msgid ""
"A tasks view is also available, making it possible for you to manage your"
" tasks and subtasks with Kalendar's powerful tree view and its customisable"
" filtering capabilities."
msgstr ""
"Tamén hai dispoñíbel unha vista de tarefas que permite xestionar as tarefas e"
" subtarefas coa potente vista de árbore de Kalendar e as súas funcionalidades"
" de filtro personalizábeis."

# skip-rule: trasno-device_reverse
#. (itstool) path: description/p
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: org.kde.kalendar.appdata.xml:18
msgid ""
"Kalendar was built with the idea to be usable on desktop, on mobile and"
" everything in between."
msgstr ""
"Kalendar construíuse para poder usarse en calquera dispositivo, desde"
" escritorios a móbiles."

